{"timestamp":"2026-08-14T03:16:15Z","action":"complaint","word":"t","murky":"e done list, a journal entry for the manager paying its own way and the file renames, one row in working features, and the map's three stale lines mended.\n- Next in [handoff.md](ov/notes/work/handoff.md): the details column's two banners become lines with words on them, the way every other folding thing in the app works. Its one open question is what line the column wants where its sections meet.","plain":"Which line goes above each of the two words.\n\nThere are three to pick from: the heavy one, the hair, and none at all. Preferences sits at the top of the column, repair sits under it.\n\nI need two answers: what the top one gets, and what the second one gets."}
